cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the accompanying research artifacts, please cite as below."
title: "Sentiment Analysis of Nepali News for NEPSE Stock Prediction Using Jev and Confidence-Gated Hybrid Architectures"
abstract: >-
  An end-to-end, reproducible research pipeline for low-resource Nepali
  financial sentiment analysis: Devanagari-aware preprocessing, a Jev
  (System One) zero-shot benchmark with calibration analysis
  (Brier / ECE / reliability), a confidence-gated hybrid pipeline with
  conformally-calibrated escalation thresholds and a cost-accuracy Pareto
  frontier, and sentiment-augmented next-day NEPSE index prediction under
  strict walk-forward validation with realistic transaction-cost
  backtesting. Ships a LaTeX paper draft, FastAPI service, Streamlit
  dashboard, Dockerfile, and GitHub Actions CI/CD.
